open NumberField ReciprocityTheory.ChartRestriction.G.Geo.Tor GlobalTheory.Toroidal GlobalTheory.LocM GlobalTheory.TorRef GlobalTheory.PolFan GlobalTheory.PolCell GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Fan

